></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>AKABA, TOSHIHISA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITA, HAKARU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IIZUKA, ISAO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIGURO, YOUICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IZUMITANI, YUKIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KURIHARA, KAZUMICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKAI, YASUSHI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>Glasses which are easy in lens replacement, excellent in portability of replacement lens, free from damage to lens, and capable of fixedly installing lenses assuredly on a frame, comprising lens side connection members (3) which are connection members to detachably install the lenses (2) on the frame part (1), formed of different members from the lenses (2), and fixed to the edge parts of the lenses (2) and a frame side connection part (120) which is connected detachably to the lens side connection members (3) and provided on the frame part (1) so as to install the lenses (2) detachably to the frame part (1).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne des lunettes qui permettent un remplacement aisé des verres, ont une excellente capacité de support de verres de remplacement, n'endommagent pas les verres et permettent un montage fixe et sûr des verres sur une monture. Les lunettes comportent des éléments (3) de connexion de bord de verre qui permettent de monter amovible les verres (2) sur la partie (1) de monture ; ces éléments sont constitués d'éléments différents des verres (2) et se fixent aux bords des verres (2) et à une partie de connexion (120) de bord de monture, laquelle est connectée amovible aux éléments (3) de connexion de bord de verre et se situe sur la partie (1) de monture pour permettre le montage amovible des verres (2) sur la partie (1) de monture.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>